WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.037
Section 7.

00:00:01.987 --> 00:00:04.975
De-policing and recruitment crisis.

00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:08.212
The RCMP is hollowing out from within.

00:00:08.212 --> 00:00:12.525
Recruitment cannot keep pace with retirements and departures.

00:00:12.525 --> 00:00:15.237
Morale is at historic lows.

00:00:15.237 --> 00:00:18.612
Officers are leaving for municipal forces.

00:00:18.612 --> 00:00:24.600
Rural communities dependent on RCMP policing face growing response time gaps.
